 row calls the handler with mem NULL on a calloc&#x27;d cpu whose machine is of type MACHINE_NONE, so any condition on caller state that holds for that one fixed caller passes all 864 rows -- `mem` and the machine type (the Opus seat&#x27;s MC01-MC05, MC07; e.g. `if (writeflag == MEM_READ &amp;&amp; !mem)` at +0x184 declines every real caller&#x27;s IRQ_RAW_STATUS read), byte order and pc (grok), and ten shapes over seven cpu fields (the Opus seat&#x27;s CX01-CX10).  Clause (e): no body of the five reads caller state.  Ready detector: the Opus seat&#x27;s scratch extension with a cats and a netwinder caller and a real mem (regress/artifacts/fbd5/q2_20260923/q2f_opus/, 871 rows, 8 of its 9 greens red).</span><span class="tip">regress/diff_footbridge.c: every #545 row calls the handler with mem NULL on a calloc&#x27;d cpu whose machine is of type MACHINE_NONE, so any condition on caller state that holds for that one fixed caller passes all 864 rows -- `mem` and the machine type (the Opus seat&#x27;s MC01-MC05, MC07; e.g. `if (writeflag == MEM_READ &amp;&amp; !mem)` at +0x184 declines every real caller&#x27;s IRQ_RAW_STATUS read), byte order and pc (grok), and ten shapes over seven cpu fields (the Opus seat&#x27;s CX01-CX10).  Clause (e): no body of the five reads caller state.  Ready detector: the Opus seat&#x27;s scratch extension with a cats and a netwinder caller and a real mem (regress/artifacts/fbd5/q2_20260923/q2f_opus/, 871 rows, 8 of its 9 greens red).</span></span><span class="state st-open">open</span></span></th></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Assessment (initial problem)</th><td class="c tok"><span class="wrap" tabindex="0"><span class="g">∅</span><span class="tip">2026-09-23 — [NOT A SEAT ANSWER] Filed by GXEMUL [087a90] (main loop) from #545&#x27;s review passes (pass 1 through repair 3e&#x27;s) -- see the row title for the finding, its seat and its evidence.</span></span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><t