ut both builds produce the same result || asanrecovercomment -- build_asan comment says recovery is on; the flags never enable it || asanchmodcomment -- build_asan says configure is untracked-mode and fails 126 without chmod || dashccluster -- dollar guard misses bash -cl and bash -e -lc || heredocopener -- dollar guard strips a heredoc opener&#x27;s trailing command and the body bash runs || quoteconcat -- dollar guard stops at the first quote of an adjacent-quote concatenation || dollarpastsemi -- unquoted wsl -c reader consumes commands after the semicolon || dollarbslashnl -- dollar guard splits backslash-newline continuations before matching wsl -c || dollarprose -- dollar guard flags documentation and inline comments as wsl invocations || wakeupstampshare -- wakeup stamp has no session id and the tmp fallback is cross-project || wakeupstampsticky -- consumed wakeup stamp still suppresses the re-arm reminder for 900s || citeprefixblind -- citation gate ignores the changelog prefix and every ## Round #N heading || blocksgarbagevacuous -- zero-heading selftest checks the parser, not the fail branch it was added to guard || trackedsubstring -- cited-artifact tracked() keys off the literal directory name GXEMUL-SEC || citeclassifycomment -- cited-artifact header still says untracked hits are classified and greened || refusalafteranswer -- dashboard omits a refused exemption once that seat has an ordinary answer || hlinetipclip -- header tooltip is positioned below an overflow-hidden hline || wallcountsasanswer -- untokened WALL counts as a stage answer || holdqblank -- hold-only stage stores a blank date and skips the question failure || censusline -- exit census counts lines, and zero sites pass || censusbucket -- exit attribution can bind a helper to the previous function || rowgitstatus -- row-state git status is discarded || rowqueueos -- unreadable queue becomes an empty pass || rowheadingsev -- severity parenthetical hides a queue heading || wallmarkerdrop --