|| pcc2iplrdvacuity -- IPL wide-read check cannot fail against pre-fix code || ppcptyfdleak -- ppc_rounding_probe session() leaks master pty file descriptor || precommitungraded -- precommit check T treats arbitrary non-grade outcome strings as graded || precommitugstatus -- precommit check T launders python failure in grading check as success || precommitpass2sub -- precommit check F unanchored regex matches &#x27;bypass 2&#x27; as pass-2 commit || receiptprefixlen -- precommit check F allows arbitrarily short 1-char prefix in receipt SHA || identguardgrep -- precommit check E identity guard check matches comment word instead of assertion || hookctlzeropass -- precommit check B hook controls accept 0 of 0 controls as pass || precommitchangedspace -- precommit_check.sh unquoted $CHANGED splits paths containing whitespace || precommitcleanskip -- clean-tree early exit skips section B .MUTANT and section Y NUL checks || seatverdictsm9 -- seat_verdicts selftest M9 mutant does not test the one-character guard || verdictssplitvacuity -- seat_verdicts selftest does not assert verdicts_of split extraction || mutantbuildlaunder -- seat_verdicts selftest scores uncompilable mutant as detected || brieflineslenfilter -- brief_lines &gt;20 threshold drops short brief lines like wrapped menu options || grepwindrivepath -- GREP_OUTPUT_LINE pattern misses Windows drive-letter paths || ollamarecoverynote -- seat_verdicts does not recognize panel_ollama empty-retry recovery envelopes || recoveredverdictsplit -- seat_verdicts uses verdict_of rather than verdicts_of on recovered text || recoveredwritelaunder -- seat_verdicts swallows write failure while advertising RECOVERED.md file || shortverdictechoonly -- seat_verdicts short &lt;=20char verdict classified as ECHO ONLY || sgiredetabsent -- determinism row reports identical when both reads absent || pcicp17noisy -- P17 omits noisy check from pass predicate || pcicp1dempty -- P1d passes write-suppression check on empty transcript || sh4pcicfdleak -- session() leaks pty master fd on all return paths || rldicldisasmgap -- the rldicl probe&#x27;s header says every placed word is disassembled; four session calls discard the returned disassembly</span></span><span class="state st-open">open</span></span></th></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Assessment (initial problem)</th><td class="c tok"><span class="wrap" tabindex="0"><span class="g">∅</span><span class="tip">2026-10-02 — [NOT A SEAT ANSWER] Filed by GXEMUL [087a90] (main loop) by #554 from the Astra review campaign (wave 2, the regression harness).  This row closes when every member is promoted, fixed or dropped; the members&#x27; rulings and evidence are in regress/artifacts/astraretro_harness_20260926/HARNESS_DISPOSITIONS.md and regress/artifacts/astrafiling_20261002/FILING.tsv.  NOT FIXED by #554.</span></span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Research (fix proposals)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td></tr><tr class="ph st-open"><th scope="row" class="phlabel">Final review (flagship adjudication)</th><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none"><span class="g">·</span></td><td class="c none">